<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed lower in heavy trading Friday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 7.45 to 6021.93. For the week, the Dow rose 14.91 points.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 0.82 to 373.68.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.08.</p>
<p>Losers beat gainers 1229 to 1147.</p>
<p>Volume was 463,777,340, compared with 482,795,210 Thursday. For the week, volume was 2,218,507,340.</p>
